      "heading": "Season the mince",
      "blocks": [
        "Stir in the stock mix listed for your serving size, the tomato paste and the curry powder."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [],
      "image": {
        "id": "beef-keema-lime-coriander-4-sketch",
