      }
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "id": "step-5",
      "heading": "Add the rice",
      "blocks": [
        "Stir the basmati rice into the pan."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [],
      "image": {
        "id": "beef-keema-lime-coriander-5-sketch",
        "path": "media/beef-keema-lime-coriander-5-sketch.webp",
        "alt": "Add the rice",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "id": "step-6",
      "heading": "Simmer",
      "blocks": [
        "Add {{rice-water}} cold water and bring to a boil over high heat. Reduce to very low, cover and cook for 10–12 minutes until the water is absorbed and the rice and mince are cooked through. Stir occasionally to prevent sticking. Add a splash of water if it looks dry."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
          "label": "Simmer the rice and mince",
          "seconds": [
            600,
            720
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image": {
        "id": "beef-keema-lime-coriander-6-sketch",
        "path": "media/beef-keema-lime-coriander-6-sketch.webp",
        "alt": "Simmer",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "id": "step-7",
      "heading": "Finish with lime and coriander",
      "blocks": [
        "Finely chop the coriander, including the stalks, saving some leaves. Stir the chopped coriander and the juice of half the lime into the rice. Taste and adjust the seasoning. Cut the remaining lime into one wedge per serving."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [],
